{"id": "EXP-001", "status": "active", "situation": "競品首頁選單有指定關鍵字的錨文字，但 robots 列出的 sitemap 索引裡找不到對應的大量頁面；資料卡分區顯示某個資料夾的網址數量異常多，而且是靠資料夾探測才找到它的獨立 sitemap。這時要確認這個資料夾是不是關鍵字量產頁群，以及指定關鍵字有哪些變體頁。", "route": "1. sitemap_tree：先 build，再對大分區做 sample 和 search 指定關鍵字，因為要知道量產頁群的網址樣式、變體頁數量，以及這些頁在哪個 sitemap 檔\n2. inspect_page：看選單錨文字連到的入口頁和 2 到 3 個關鍵字變體頁的 summary，因為要比對模板結構、canonical 和 JSON-LD\n3. inspect_page：用 link_filter 篩外連品牌和同資料夾的連結，因為要確認 CTA 的 rel、推廣參數和站內互連數\n4. polite_fetch：讀 robots.txt，核對這個 sitemap 有沒有列在 robots，因為要確認是否只有探測才找得到", "result": "照走", "avoid_reason": "", "paired_id": "", "evidence_ids": ["E-0103", "E-0104", "E-0107", "E-0154", "E-0108", "E-0110", "E-0114", "E-0150", "E-0151", "E-0135"], "route_tools": [{"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0103"], "call_n": 6}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0104"], "call_n": 7}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0107"], "call_n": 10}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0108"], "call_n": 11}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0110"], "call_n": 12}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a 娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0114"], "call_n": 14}, {"tool": "polite_fetch", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/robots.txt", "evidence_ids": ["E-0135"], "call_n": 23}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0150"], "call_n": 29}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0151"], "call_n": 30}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0154"], "call_n": 34}], "route_summary": [{"n": 6, "tool": "sitemap_tree", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/"}, "why": "先讀入 sitemap 以便分區展開", "evidence_ids": ["E-0103"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 7, "tool": "sitema