{"id": "EXP-002", "status": "active", "situation": "RDAP 的註冊日期很新，但 Wayback 存檔早好幾年；sitemap 裡還有看起來像舊站短網址代碼或舊分類名的分區。這時懷疑是過期網域再利用，要確認舊站主題，以及新站有沒有沿用舊網址。", "route": "1. wayback：用 old_urls 列舊網址，再用 snapshot 讀一個舊首頁，因為要知道舊站主題和當年用過的網址樣式\n2. wayback：用 check_current 看舊網址現在回什麼狀態碼，因為要分出哪些舊網址被接住、哪些已失效\n3. polite_fetch：跟著轉址抓被接住的舊網址最終頁，再用 inspect_page 看內容，因為只看轉址可能只是補斜線\n4. sitemap_tree：search 舊代碼字首，核對 sitemap 裡有幾個同名頁，因為只驗一頁不能推成策略", "result": "照走", "avoid_reason": "", "paired_id": "", "evidence_ids": ["E-0119", "E-0145", "E-0147", "E-0128", "E-0130", "E-0134", "E-0157", "E-0162", "E-0156", "E-0155"], "route_tools": [{"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0119"], "call_n": 16}, {"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/2kAPB2a", "evidence_ids": ["E-0128"], "call_n": 17}, {"tool": "polite_fetch", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/2kAPB2a/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0130"], "call_n": 19}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/2kAPB2a/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0130", "E-0134"], "call_n": 22}, {"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0145"], "call_n": 25}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "web.archive.org", "path": "/web/20240525015210id_/https://2030.tw/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0145", "E-0147"], "call_n": 26}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0155"], "call_n": 35}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0156"], "call_n": 36}, {"tool": "polite_fetch", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/5G_Taiwan/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0157"], "call_n": 37}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/5G_Taiwan/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0157", "E-0162"], "call_n": 41}], "route_summary": [{"n": 16, "tool": "wayback", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/"}, "why": "網域 2026-04 才註冊但存檔從 2020 起：查舊站內容判斷是否為過期網域再利用", "evidence_ids": ["E-0118", "E-0119"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 17, "tool": "wayback", "target": {"domain": "2030.t