{"id": "EXP-003", "status": "active", "situation": "量產頁群的頁面上，顯示的「更新」日期和 JSON-LD dateModified 很接近抓取當天，但 og 日期和 sitemap lastmod 停在好幾個月前；網站前面有 CDN 快取。這時要分清楚：這些日期是刻意營造新鮮度，還是快取產生時間的副作用。", "route": "1. inspect_page：看量產頁的 jsonld 和 summary，記下顯示日期、JSON-LD 日期和 og 日期，因為三者對不上才需要追查\n2. polite_fetch：重抓同一頁，看 last-modified、age、快取命中標頭，因為日期可能就是快取產生時間\n3. text_match：在另一個同類頁搜尋「更新」和 dateModified，因為只看一頁不能推到整個頁群\n4. inspect_page：再抽 3 頁以上，比較頁首日期是否各不相同，因為各頁快取時間不同時，日期也會跟著不同", "result": "照走", "avoid_reason": "", "paired_id": "", "evidence_ids": ["E-0108", "E-0153", "E-0168", "E-0155", "E-0156", "E-0178", "E-0176"], "route_tools": [{"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0108"], "call_n": 8}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0108"], "call_n": 9}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0108"], "call_n": 10}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0108", "E-0153"], "call_n": 30}, {"tool": "text_match", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城官網", "evidence_ids": ["E-0155", "E-0156"], "call_n": 32}, {"tool": "polite_fetch", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0168"], "call_n": 37}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/娛樂城返水", "evidence_ids": ["E-0176"], "call_n": 43}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城不出金", "evidence_ids": ["E-0178"], "call_n": 44}], "route_summary": [{"n": 8, "tool": "inspect_page", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城"}, "why": "EXP-001 看指定關鍵字變體頁模板", "evidence_ids": ["E-0108", "E-0109"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 9, "tool": "inspect_page", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城"}, "why": "EXP-001 看 CTA rel 與推廣參數", "evidence_ids": ["E-0108", "E-0110"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 10, "tool": "inspect_page", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城"}, "why": "EXP-001 看同資料夾站內互連", "evidence_ids": ["E-0108", "E-0111"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 30, "tool": "inspect_page", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城"}, "why": "確認量產頁 FAQPage 與錯置實體細節", "evidence_ids": ["E-0108", "E-0153"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 32, "tool": "text_match", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城官網"}, "why": "第三個 3A 變體頁：看顯示更新日期、JSON-LD 日期與推廣參數是否一致套版", "evidence_ids": ["E-0155", "E-0156"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 37, "tool": "polite_fetch", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城"}, "why": "重抓同一頁看快取標頭與日期是否變動（R3）", "evidence_ids": ["E-0168"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 43, "tool": "inspect_page", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/娛樂城返水"}, "why": "EXP-001 擴大量產頁抽樣（R2），資訊型關鍵字", "evidence_ids": ["E-0176", "E-0177"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 44, "tool": "inspect_page", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城不出金"}, "why": "EXP-001 擴大 3a 變體抽樣（R2）", "evidence_ids": ["E-0178", "E-0179"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}], "source_run": "sim-r2", "proposal_id": "P1", "added_at": "2026-11-17T21:08:47+0800", "no_value_streak": 0, "history": [{"run": "sim-r3", "verdict": "有用到＋有新東西"}, {"run": "sim-r4", "verdict": "有用到＋有新東西"}, {"run": "sim-r5", "verdict": "有用到＋有新東西"}]}
{"id": "EXP-004", "status": "active", "situation": "舊網址樣式和新網址很像，但只差在大小寫或結尾斜線；或舊網址轉址一次就停住。這時不能把永久轉址直接算成「接住舊網址」，要追到最終落點，看是不是新內容、canonical 指向哪裡。", "route": "1. wayback：用 snapshot 讀舊首頁，再用 inspect_page 列出舊連結，因為要拿到舊站真實網址和大小寫\n2. wayback：對舊網址做 check_current，因為要分出失效、只補斜線的轉址、轉到別頁的轉址\n3. wayback：對只補斜線的轉址落點再做一次 check_current，因為第一跳可能只是斜線轉址\n4. inspect_page：看最終成功頁的 title 和 canonical，因為要確認是否被新內容接住、指向哪個新網址", "result": "照走", "avoid_reason": "", "paired_id": "", "evidence_ids": ["E-0119", "E-0127", "E-0140", "E-0150", "E-0169", "E-0170"], "route_tools": [{"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0119"], "call_n": 15}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "web.archive.org", "path": "/web/20240525015210id_/https://2030.tw/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0119"], "call_n": 18}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "web.archive.org", "path": "/web/20240525015210id_/https://2030.tw/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0119", "E-0127"], "call_n": 21}, {"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/article/The-Twin-Green-Digital-Transition-Sunnyfounder", "evidence_ids": ["E-0140"], "call_n": 23}, {"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/article/The-Twin-Green-Digital-Transition-ITRI-NZSSO", "evidence_ids": ["E-0150"], "call_n": 28}, {"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/article/The-Twin-Green-Digital-Transition-ITRI-NZSSO/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0170"], "call_n": 38}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/article/The-Twin-Green-Digital-Transition-ITRI-NZSSO/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0169"], "call_n": 41}], "route_summary": [{"n": 15, "tool": "wayback", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/"}, "why": "EXP-002 讀舊首頁了解舊站主題", "evidence_ids": ["E-0119", "E-0120"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 18, "tool": "inspect_page", "target": {"domain": "web.archive.org", "path": "/web/20240525015210id_/https://2030.tw/"}, "why": "EXP-002 讀 2024 舊首頁主題", "evidence_ids": ["E-0119", "E-0123"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 21, "tool": "i