{"id": "EXP-005", "status": "active", "situation": "量產頁上有兩組 JSON-LD，日期互相矛盾：一組是錯置的其他頁實體、日期很舊，另一組日期很接近抓取當天。頁首也顯示「更新」日期，網站前面有 CDN 快取。這時要分清楚每個日期各自對應到什麼。", "route": "1. inspect_page：用 part=jsonld 讀出原始 JSON-LD，因為摘要只列類型，看不到兩組各自的日期\n2. polite_fetch：用 GET 重抓同一頁，記下 last-modified 和 age 標頭，因為 HEAD 回應可能沒有內容可以比對\n3. text_match：在這份重抓結果的 html 裡搜 dateModified、更新、generator，因為標頭和日期要在同一份證據裡比對才算數", "result": "照走", "avoid_reason": "", "paired_id": "", "evidence_ids": ["E-0154", "E-0155", "E-0170"], "route_tools": [{"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0154"], "call_n": 29}, {"tool": "polite_fetch", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0155"], "call_n": 31}, {"tool": "text_match", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0155", "E-0170"], "call_n": 35}], "route_summary": [{"n": 29, "tool": "inspect_page", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城"}, "why": "確認娛樂城頁 FAQPage 與錯置的 MLB 實體", "evidence_ids": ["E-0111", "E-0154"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 31, "tool": "polite_fetch", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城"}, "why": "EXP-003 重抓同一頁看快取標頭與日期是否變動（審查 R1/R2）", "evidence_ids": ["E-0155"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 35, "tool": "text_match", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城"}, "why": "EXP-003 同一份即時抓取裡核對日期與 generator（審查 R1/R2/R7）", "evidence_ids": ["E-0155", "E-0170"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}], "source_run": "sim-r3", "proposal_id": "P1", "added_at": "2026-11-17T21:18:15+0800", "no_value_streak": 0, "history": [{"run": "sim-r4", "verdict": "有用到＋有新東西"}, {"run": "sim-r5", "verdict": "有用到＋有新東西"}]}
{"id": "EXP-006", "status": "active", "situation": "網域目前的註冊日期很新，但存檔顯示舊站是另一個主題的機構網站；新站的選單或頁尾連到看起來像舊站文章代號、舊分類名的網址。這時要確認新站是不是把舊網址重建成新主題內容，以及哪些舊網址被放棄。", "route": "1. inspect_page：對一個內頁用 link_filter 篩全部連結，列出選單和頁尾網址，因為選單常直接指向被重建的舊網址\n2. sitemap_tree：search 舊文章資料夾，核對 sitemap 裡沿用舊代號的頁，因為要分清楚是個案還是一批\n3. wayback：對失效的舊網址，用補斜線和小寫版本再做 check_current，因為原樣失效可能只是格式不符\n4. polite_fetch：用 follow_redirects=false 抓舊網址，拿到轉址的 Location 標頭，因為存檔檢查可能沒列出目的地", "result": "照走", "avoid_reason": "", "paired_id": "", "evidence_ids": ["E-0179", "E-0180", "E-0178", "E-0168", "E-0169"], "route_tools": [{"tool": "polite_fetch", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/2kRmVSF", "evidence_ids": ["E-0168"], "call_n": 33}, {"tool": "polite_fetch", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/AI_Taiwan", "evidence_ids": ["E-0169"], "call_n": 34}, {"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/article/smart-nation-70/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0178"], "call_n": 36}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/taiwanplus/mlb-live-20260822-sf-vs-bos/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0179"], "call_n": 37}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0180"], "call_n": 38}], "route_summary": [{"n": 33, "tool": "polite_fetch", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/2kRmVSF"}, "why": "EXP-004 審查 R11：看原始 301 Location", "evidence_ids": ["E-0168"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 34, "tool": "polite_fetch", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/AI_Taiwan"}, "why": "EXP-004 審查 R11：看原始 301 Location", "evidence_ids": ["E-0169"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 36, "tool": "wayback", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/article/smart-nation-70/"}, "why": "EXP-004 審查 R12：404 舊網址改補斜線/小寫重試", "evidence_ids": ["E-0178"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 37, "tool": "inspect_page", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/taiwanplus/mlb-live-20260822-sf-vs-bos/"}, "why": "審查 R9/R17：賽事頁外連 rel 與是否連到 /wordcup/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0148", "E-0179"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 38, "tool": "sitemap_tree", "target": null, "why": "EXP-002 sitemap 中沿用舊文章 slug 的頁", "evidence_ids": ["E-0180"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}], "source_run": "sim-r3", "proposal_id": "P2", "added_at": "2026-11-17T21:18:15+0800", "no_value_streak": 0, "history": [{"run": "sim-r4", "verdict": "有用到＋有新東西"}, {"run": "sim-r5", "verdict": "有用到＋有新東西"}]}
{"id": "EXP-007", "status": "active", "situation": "競品網域目前的註冊日期很新，存檔卻顯示舊站是另一個主題；新站選單連到看起來像舊站文章代號的網址，舊短網址或舊分類名用大寫寫成，不帶斜線時會先轉址。這時要確認舊網址是被重建成新主題內容，還是已經失效；另外，存檔服務可能限流。", "route": "1. polite_fetch：用 follow_redirects=false 抓舊大寫網址拿 Location 標頭，因為存檔檢查看不到轉址目的地\n2. inspect_page：跟轉址抓最終頁看 title 和 canonical，因為要確認是不是新主題、指向哪個小寫網址\n3. inspect_page：對內頁用 link_filter 篩選單連結並和存檔舊網址對照，因為存檔被限流時選單仍能證明舊代號被重用\n4. polite_fetch：對失效的舊文章再試帶斜線的版本，因為只試一種格式不能斷定已放棄", "result": "照走", "avoid_reason": "", "paired_id": "", "evidence_ids": ["E-0178", "E-0179", "E-0182", "E-0124", "E-0181"], "route_tools": [{"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0124"], "call_n": 19}, {"tool": "polite_fetch", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/2kAPB2a", "evidence_ids": ["E-0178"], "call_n": 37}, {"tool": "polite_fetch", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/5G_Taiwan", "evidence_ids": ["E-0179"], "call_n": 38}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/5G_Taiwan/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0179"], "call_n": 39}, {"tool": "polite_fetch", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/article/cover-story-04/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0181"], "call_n": 40}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0182"], "call_n": 41}], "route_summary": [{"n": 19, "tool": "wayback", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/"}, "why": "EXP-002 註冊日很新但存檔早；查舊站主題與舊網址", "evidence_ids": ["E-0124", "E-0125"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 37, "tool": "polite_fetch", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/2kAPB2a"}, "why": "EXP-006 R13 取舊短網址轉址的 Location 標頭", "evidence_ids": ["E-0178"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 38, "tool": "polite_fetch", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/5G_Taiwan"}, "why": "EXP-006 R15 跟著轉址看舊大寫分類網址最終落點", "evidence_ids": ["E-0179"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 39, "tool": "inspect_page", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/5G_Taiwan/"}, "why": "R15 舊大寫分類網址最終頁的 title/canonical", "evidence_ids": ["E-0179", "E-0180