{"id": "EXP-008", "status": "active", "situation": "第一次 build sitemap 時，某個 sitemap 檔回 5xx，報告裡的關鍵字網址數因此可能偏低；重新 build 又會沿用快取，沒有重讀那個檔。這時要確認漏讀的檔裡有沒有指定關鍵字的網址，數字才能當作完整的。", "route": "1. sitemap_tree：build 後對指定關鍵字做 search，記下 matches 和 by_sitemap，因為要知道網址數在哪幾個檔\n2. polite_fetch：直接重抓回 5xx 的 sitemap 檔，因為重新 build 可能沿用快取、不會重讀\n3. text_match：在重抓的 sitemap 原檔 html 裡搜關鍵字和量產資料夾名，因為要確認漏讀的檔有沒有相關網址", "result": "照走", "avoid_reason": "", "paired_id": "", "evidence_ids": ["E-0106", "E-0105", "E-0147", "E-0181"], "route_tools": [{"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0105"], "call_n": 6}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0106"], "call_n": 7}, {"tool": "polite_fetch", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/post-sitemap1.xml", "evidence_ids": ["E-0147"], "call_n": 30}, {"tool": "text_match", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/post-sitemap1.xml", "evidence_ids": ["E-0147", "E-0181"], "call_n": 45}], "route_summary": [{"n": 6, "tool": "sitemap_tree", "target": null, "why": "EXP-001 找 3A娛樂城 變體頁", "evidence_ids": ["E-0105"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 7, "tool": "sitemap_tree", "target": null, "why": "EXP-001 娛樂城 網址數與所在 sitemap 檔", "evidence_ids": ["E-0106"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 30, "tool": "polite_fetch", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/post-sitemap1.xml"}, "why": "重試 525 的 sitemap，確認資料卡 taiwanplus/mlb 數量差異來源", "evidence_ids": ["E-0147"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 45, "tool": "text_match", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/post-sitemap1.xml"}, "why": "R5：確認 post-sitemap1 裡有沒有娛樂城/3a 網址", "evidence_ids": ["E-0147", "E-0181"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}], "source_run": "sim-r5", "proposal_id": "P1", "added_at": "2026-11-17T21:39:26+0800"}
{"id": "EXP-009", "status": "active", "situation": "網域的舊站是另一個主題的機構網站，新站 sitemap 裡有看起來像舊文章代號的網址，但存檔服務列舊網址清單時一直逾時。這時要用逐頁查存檔的方式，證明這些代號是舊站真的用過的網址，以及新站在這些網址上放了什麼內容。", "route": "1. wayback：對單一舊代號網址做 timeline，因為列舊網址清單逾時時，單頁時間線仍能證明舊站用過\n2. wayback：對不帶斜線的舊代號做 check_current，因為要知道舊格式是否永久轉址到新網址\n3. inspect_page：抓補斜線後的頁看 title 和 canonical，因為只有轉址不能證明內容已換主題\n4. wayback：對舊路徑名的大小寫版本做 timeline，因為舊站路徑常是大寫，新站改成小寫", "result": "照走", "avoid_reason": "", "paired_id": "", "evidence_ids": ["E-0164", "E-0169", "E-0143", "E-0179", "E-0178"], "route_tools": [{"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/article/responsible-ai-008-audrey-tang/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0143"], "call_n": 27}, {"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/article/responsible-ai-008-audrey-tang", "evidence_ids": ["E-0164"], "call_n": 35}, {"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/article/responsible-ai-008-audrey-tang", "evidence_ids": ["E-0169"], "call_n": 36}, {"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/5g_taiwan/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0178"], "call_n": 43}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/article/space-tech-003-industry/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0179"], "call_n": 44}], "route_summary": [{"n": 27, "tool": "inspect_page", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/article/responsible-ai-008-audrey-tang/"}, "why": "EXP-006 沿用舊文章代號的頁是重建舊內容還是換成新主題", "evidence_ids": ["E-0143", "E-0144"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 35, "tool": "wayback", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/article/responsible-ai-008-audrey-tang"}, "why": "EXP-002 被重用的舊文章代號在舊站是否存在", "evidence_ids": ["E-0163", "E-0164"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 36, "tool": "wayback", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/article/responsible-ai-008-audrey-tang"}, "why": "EXP-004 舊無斜線網址是否 301 到被重建的新頁", "evidence_ids": ["E-0169"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 43, "tool": "wayback", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/5g_taiwan/"}, "why": "R15：舊站是否用過 5g_taiwan 路徑", "evidence_ids": ["E-0177", "E-0178"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}, {"n": 44, "tool": "inspect_page", "target": {"domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/article/space-tech-003-industry/"}, "why": "R14：第二個舊代號補斜線後的內容", "evidence_ids": ["E-0179", "E-0180"], "ok": true, "light_test_of": null}], "source_run": "sim-r5", "proposal_id": "P2", "added_at": "2026-11-17T21:39:26+0800"}
